{"seq":2,"slug":"flag-evaluation-performance","title":"开关评估性能：延迟优化与规则引擎设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/feature-flags-progressive-delivery/engineering/flag-evaluation-performance","wordCount":1507,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"开关评估性能-延迟优化与规则引擎设计\">开关评估性能：延迟优化与规则引擎设计</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>开关评估位于应用的<strong>热路径</strong>上：每个请求可能触发数十次评估，单次延迟会被请求量放大成可观的总开销。评估性能的核心命题，就是让&quot;给定上下文求开关值&quot;这件事在极高并发下依然廉价且稳定。</p>\n<p>本节围绕这一命题展开几个概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>规则引擎的数据结构</strong>：从朴素线性遍历，到预编译 HashSet、短路求值、规则索引，用结构换时间；</li>\n<li><strong>哈希成本</strong>：百分比评估依赖哈希，算法选择（MurmurHash3/xxHash 对密码学哈希）带来数量级差异；</li>\n<li><strong>缓存与并发</strong>：请求级/用户级缓存减少重复计算，读写锁或无锁 Copy-on-Write 支撑高并发读。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"评估性能为何关键\">评估性能为何关键</h2><p>特性开关的评估处于应用程序的<strong>热路径</strong>（Hot Path）上——每个用户请求可能触发数十乃至上百次开关评估。快手 2026 年的数据表明，其短视频主业务<strong>每秒开关调用 155 亿次</strong>。在这种规模下，每次评估增加 1 微秒的延迟，就意味着每秒增加 155 亿微秒 = 约 4300 小时的 CPU 时间。</p>\n<p>评估延迟的目标：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>目标延迟</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>进程内本地评估</td>\n<td>&lt; 50 微秒</td>\n<td>内存查找 + 规则匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边缘评估</td>\n<td>&lt; 5 毫秒</td>\n<td>Edge KV 读取 + 计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>远程评估</td>\n<td>&lt; 20 毫秒</td>\n<td>网络往返 + 服务端计算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>超过这些阈值，开关系统会从&quot;无感知的基础设施&quot;变为&quot;可观测的性能瓶颈&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规则引擎的核心数据结构\">规则引擎的核心数据结构</h2><h3 id=\"规则匹配的朴素实现\">规则匹配的朴素实现</h3><p>最直接的实现是线性遍历所有规则，逐条检查是否匹配：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def evaluate_naive(flag: Flag, context: dict) -&gt; str:&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;O(n) 线性遍历——小规则集足够，大规则集成瓶颈&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    for rule in flag.rules:&#10;        if all(check_condition(c, context) for c in rule.conditions):&#10;            return rule.variation&#10;    return flag.default_variation\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> evaluate_naive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(flag: Flag, context: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"O(n) 线性遍历——小规则集足够，大规则集成瓶颈\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rule </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flag.rules:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(check_condition(c, context) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rule.conditions):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rule.variation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flag.default_variation</span></span></code></pre></div><p>时间复杂度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(R \\times C)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 是规则数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 是每条规则的条件数。对于简单开关（3-5 条规则）足够快，但当开关规则包含数百个白名单用户或复杂的属性组合时，性能退化明显。</p>\n<h3 id=\"优化一-集合查找加速\">优化一：集合查找加速</h3><p>将 <code>in</code> / <code>not_in</code> 类条件的值列表预编译为 HashSet：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"type CompiledRule struct {&#10;    Conditions []CompiledCondition&#10;    Variation  string&#10;}&#10;&#10;type CompiledCondition struct {&#10;    Attribute string&#10;    Operator  Operator&#10;    // 预编译的查找结构&#10;    ValueSet  map[string]struct{}   // in/not_in 用 HashSet O(1)&#10;    ValueNum  float64              // gt/lt 用数值比较&#10;    Regex     *regexp.Regexp       // regex 预编译&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CompiledRule</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Conditions []</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">CompiledCondition</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Variation  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CompiledCondition</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Attribute </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Operator  </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Operator</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 预编译的查找结构</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ValueSet  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// in/not_in 用 HashSet O(1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ValueNum  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float64</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">              // gt/lt 用数值比较</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Regex     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">regexp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Regexp</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       // regex 预编译</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>将 <code>in [&quot;user-001&quot;, &quot;user-002&quot;, ..., &quot;user-10000&quot;]</code> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 线性扫描优化到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 哈希查找。当白名单有数千条时，性能差异是数量级的。</p>\n<h3 id=\"优化二-短路求值\">优化二：短路求值</h3><p>规则条件间使用 AND 逻辑时，一旦某个条件不满足即可跳过后续条件：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    C1[条件1: country=CN] --&gt; Check1{满足?}&#10;    Check1 -- 否 --&gt; Skip[跳过此规则]&#10;    Check1 -- 是 --&gt; C2[条件2: tier=enterprise]&#10;    C2 --&gt; Check2{满足?}&#10;    Check2 -- 否 --&gt; Skip&#10;    Check2 -- 是 --&gt; C3[条件3: version&gt;=5.0]&#10;    C3 --&gt; Check3{满足?}&#10;    Check3 -- 否 --&gt; Skip&#10;    Check3 -- 是 --&gt; Match[规则命中]\">flowchart LR\n    C1[条件1: country=CN] --&gt; Check1{满足?}\n    Check1 -- 否 --&gt; Skip[跳过此规则]\n    Check1 -- 是 --&gt; C2[条件2: tier=enterprise]\n    C2 --&gt; Check2{满足?}\n    Check2 -- 否 --&gt; Skip\n    Check2 -- 是 --&gt; C3[条件3: version&gt;=5.0]\n    C3 --&gt; Check3{满足?}\n    Check3 -- 否 --&gt; Skip\n    Check3 -- 是 --&gt; Match[规则命中]</pre><p>进一步优化：将<strong>区分度最高</strong>（最能快速排除的）条件排在前面。例如，<code>tier=enterprise</code> 只匹配 5% 的用户，放在第一位可以让 95% 的请求在第一个条件就短路。</p>\n<h3 id=\"优化三-规则索引\">优化三：规则索引</h3><p>当单个开关有大量规则时（如按组织分流的 SaaS 产品），可以对规则建立索引：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 基于属性值的规则索引&#10;interface RuleIndex {&#10;  // 按 orgId 索引：快速定位适用的规则子集&#10;  byOrgId: Map&lt;string, Rule[]&gt;;&#10;  // 按 tier 索引&#10;  byTier: Map&lt;string, Rule[]&gt;;&#10;  // 无法索引的规则（百分比、正则等）&#10;  fallthrough: Rule[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;function evaluateWithIndex(flag: Flag, context: Context): string {&#10;  const index = flag.ruleIndex;&#10;&#10;  // 先查索引，缩小候选规则集&#10;  const candidates = index.byOrgId.get(context.orgId) ?? [];&#10;&#10;  // 只遍历候选子集&#10;  for (const rule of candidates) {&#10;    if (matchesAllConditions(rule, context)) {&#10;      return rule.variation;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  // 再检查 fallthrough 规则&#10;  for (const rule of index.fallthrough) {&#10;    if (matchesAllConditions(rule, context)) {&#10;      return rule.variation;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return flag.defaultVariation;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 基于属性值的规则索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RuleIndex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 按 orgId 索引：快速定位适用的规则子集</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  byOrgId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 按 tier 索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  byTier</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 无法索引的规则（百分比、正则等）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  fallthrough</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> evaluateWithIndex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">flag</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Flag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">context</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> index</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flag.ruleIndex;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 先查索引，缩小候选规则集</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> candidates</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> index.byOrgId.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(context.orgId) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 只遍历候选子集</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> rule</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> candidates) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">matchesAllConditions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rule, context)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#